                  "value": "Chapter 2 uses firm-level data from the World Bank Enterprise Surveys (WBES) for selected countries in Sub-Saharan Africa covering the period 2013 to 2018. The WBES provides firm-level data on registered firms in the private sector. The data is collected via face-to-face interviews with business owners and managers of small, medium, and large firms."
